config NICOCHRISTMANN_FAKEKMS

tristate "Fake KMS driver on top of the first fbdev"

depends on DRM

select FB

select BACKLIGHT_LCD_SUPPORT

select BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE

select DRM_KMS_HELPER

default m

help
  Exposes a minimal atomic KMS device (one CRTC, plane and connector)
  whose dumb buffers are copied into the first registered framebuffer
  device, followed by a pan_display to make the fbdev driver show the
  frame. Lets KMS-only userspace run on fbdev-only display drivers.
